{
  "info": {
    "name": "GestaoFerias — v3-2 Import Tirvu",
    "description": "Smoke tests para todos os endpoints da feature de importação Tirvu (backend completo: Stories 1.2/1.3/3.2/4.0a/4.0b).\n\n## Setup\n1. Importar este arquivo + o `v3-2-import-tirvu.postman_environment.json`\n2. Selecionar o environment no canto superior direito\n3. Preencher: BASE, JWT_SUPER, JWT_ADMIN, TENANT_ID\n4. Para gerar JWT: rodar `POST {{BASE}}/auth/login` (não incluído aqui — feature legada V3)\n\n## Fluxo recomendado\n1. Upload (1.1 ou 1.2) → salva `JOB_ID` automaticamente\n2. Status (3.1) — polle até `PREVIEW_READY`\n3. Preview (4.1)\n4. Apply (5.1)\n5. Status (3.1) — polle até `COMPLETED`\n6. Error report (7.1) — se houver inválidos\n\n## Idempotência\nRepetir o ciclo com o mesmo arquivo: 2ª passada deve resultar em `rowsCreated=0, rowsUpdated=0`.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_postman_id": "v3-2-import-tirvu-2026-05-01"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Upload SuperAdmin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1.1 POST /admin/imports/employees (happy path)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201))",
                  "const json = pm.response.json()",
                  "pm.test('Envelope V3', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('data')",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('error')",
                  "  pm.expect(json).to.have.property('meta')",
                  "})",
                  "pm.test('jobId is UUID', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.jobId).to.match(/^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i)",
                  "})",
                  "pm.test('status PENDING', () => pm.expect(json.data.status).to.equal('PENDING'))",
                  "pm.environment.set('JOB_ID', json.data.jobId)",
                  "console.log('Saved JOB_ID:', json.data.jobId)"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_SUPER}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Selecionar docs/exemplo/Colaboradores, para fins de validação.xlsx"
                },
                { "key": "tenantId", "type": "text", "value": "{{TENANT_ID}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{BASE}}/admin/imports/employees"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.2 POST sem file → 400 INVALID_FILE_FORMAT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400))",
                  "pm.test('code INVALID_FILE_FORMAT', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.equal('INVALID_FILE_FORMAT')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_SUPER}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                { "key": "tenantId", "type": "text", "value": "{{TENANT_ID}}" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{BASE}}/admin/imports/employees"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "1.3 POST tenantId não-UUID → 400 INVALID_TARGET_TENANT",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400))",
                  "pm.test('code INVALID_TARGET_TENANT', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.equal('INVALID_TARGET_TENANT')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_SUPER}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Selecionar qualquer .xlsx"
                },
                { "key": "tenantId", "type": "text", "value": "not-a-uuid" }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{BASE}}/admin/imports/employees"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Upload TenantAdmin",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "2.1 POST /imports/employees (tenantId via JWT)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201))",
                  "const json = pm.response.json()",
                  "pm.test('jobId presente', () => pm.expect(json.data.jobId).to.be.a('string'))",
                  "pm.environment.set('JOB_ID', json.data.jobId)"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Selecionar .xlsx Tirvu"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/employees"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2.2 POST com tenantId no body → ignorado (tenantId vem do JWT)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201))",
                  "// O backend ignora tenantId do payload silenciosamente"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "formdata",
              "formdata": [
                {
                  "key": "file",
                  "type": "file",
                  "src": [],
                  "description": "Selecionar .xlsx"
                },
                {
                  "key": "tenantId",
                  "type": "text",
                  "value": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
                  "description": "deve ser ignorado"
                }
              ]
            },
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/employees"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "3. Status (polling)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "3.1 GET /imports/:jobId — Tenant",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200))",
                  "const json = pm.response.json()",
                  "console.log('job status:', json.data.status, '| processed:', json.data.rowsProcessed, '/', json.data.totalRows)",
                  "pm.test('previewSummary.sampleRows omitido (peso)', () => {",
                  "  if (json.data.previewSummary) {",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.previewSummary).to.not.have.property('sampleRows')",
                  "    pm.expect(json.data.previewSummary).to.have.property('counts')",
                  "  }",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.2 GET /admin/imports/:jobId — SuperAdmin",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_SUPER}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{BASE}}/admin/imports/{{JOB_ID}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3.3 GET cross-tenant → 404 (não vaza existência)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 404', () => pm.response.to.have.status(404))",
                  "pm.test('code JOB_NOT_FOUND', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.equal('JOB_NOT_FOUND')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Authorization",
                "value": "Bearer {{JWT_OTHER_TENANT}}",
                "description": "JWT de tenant diferente"
              }
            ],
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "4. Preview paginado",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "4.1 GET /imports/:jobId/preview — sem filtros",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200))",
                  "const json = pm.response.json()",
                  "pm.test('rows + counts + newWorkplaces', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.rows).to.be.an('array')",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.counts).to.have.property('create')",
                  "  pm.expect(json.data.newWorkplaces).to.be.an('array')",
                  "})",
                  "pm.test('meta.pagination presente', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(json.meta.pagination).to.have.all.keys('page', 'limit', 'total', 'totalPages')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}/preview?page=1&limit=50",
              "host": ["{{BASE}}"],
              "path": ["imports", "{{JOB_ID}}", "preview"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "1" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "50" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.2 GET preview?status=invalid",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200))",
                  "const rows = pm.response.json().data.rows",
                  "pm.test('todas com status=invalid', () => {",
                  "  rows.forEach(r => pm.expect(r.status).to.equal('invalid'))",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}/preview?status=invalid",
              "host": ["{{BASE}}"],
              "path": ["imports", "{{JOB_ID}}", "preview"],
              "query": [{ "key": "status", "value": "invalid" }]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.3 GET preview?page=2&limit=10",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}/preview?page=2&limit=10",
              "host": ["{{BASE}}"],
              "path": ["imports", "{{JOB_ID}}", "preview"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "page", "value": "2" },
                { "key": "limit", "value": "10" }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "4.4 GET preview em PARSING → 409 INVALID_JOB_STATE",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 409', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409))",
                  "pm.test('code INVALID_JOB_STATE', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.equal('INVALID_JOB_STATE')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID_PARSING}}/preview",
            "description": "Definir JOB_ID_PARSING como um job recém-criado, antes do worker terminar parse"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "5. Apply",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "5.1 POST /imports/:jobId/apply (happy path)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 202', () => pm.response.to.have.status(202))",
                  "pm.test('status APPLYING', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.status).to.equal('APPLYING')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"confirmTenantName\": \"{{TENANT_NAME}}\",\n  \"createWorkplaces\": [\"ANATEL\"],\n  \"markAbsentAsPending\": false,\n  \"reactivateAll\": false\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}/apply"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5.2 POST apply com confirmTenantName errado → 400 CONFIRMATION_MISMATCH",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 400', () => pm.response.to.have.status(400))",
                  "pm.test('code CONFIRMATION_MISMATCH', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().error.code).to.equal('CONFIRMATION_MISMATCH')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"confirmTenantName\": \"NOME-ERRADO\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}/apply"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "5.3 POST apply em job já COMPLETED → 409 INVALID_JOB_STATE",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" },
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{ \"confirmTenantName\": \"{{TENANT_NAME}}\" }"
            },
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID_COMPLETED}}/apply"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "6. Cancel",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "6.1 POST /imports/:jobId/cancel (PREVIEW_READY)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200))",
                  "pm.test('status CANCELLED', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.json().data.status).to.equal('CANCELLED')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}/cancel"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "6.2 POST cancel 2× → 409 (já cancelado)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 409', () => pm.response.to.have.status(409))"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}/cancel"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "7. Error report",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "7.1 GET /imports/:jobId/error-report.xlsx (job com inválidos)",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200))",
                  "pm.test('Content-Type xlsx', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Type')).to.include('officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet')",
                  "})",
                  "pm.test('Content-Disposition attachment', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(pm.response.headers.get('Content-Disposition')).to.include('attachment')",
                  "})"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID_WITH_INVALID}}/error-report.xlsx",
            "description": "Use um JOB_ID gerado a partir do fixture tirvu-mixed-errors.xlsx (5 inválidos). Postman vai oferecer 'Save Response → Save to file' — abrir no Excel para validar."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "7.2 GET error-report em job sem inválidos → 204",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204))"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{JWT_ADMIN}}" }
            ],
            "url": "{{BASE}}/imports/{{JOB_ID}}/error-report.xlsx"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "8. Auth/permission edge cases",
      "item": [
